bender (0.1.13) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Maintenance actions all ask before running; package updates have no time
    limit, run non-interactively and keep changed config files; System Update
    uses nala when installed, otherwise apt-get.
  * Shared-memory and /tmp clean-up only delete the user's own unused files
    that are over a day old.
  * Port checker uses ss (sees system services); lsof no longer needed.
  * Security badges judge each check's own output.
  * Weather fetches only when asked; location remembered locally.
  * Proxy: warns when tinyproxy filtering is off; blocklist editor can't
    overwrite an unreadable list; Steven Black update merges or replaces.
  * Release fails if any signature can't be made.

 -- Chuck Talk <chuck@nordheim.online>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0500

